        "raw": "<p>So I was playing Captain Cosmic in the card game, and I had a thought.</p><p>I&#39;d really like to see the double tall from Construct Cataclysm, or a similar construct in Prime Wars.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>It could be 2 hexes, you place it, and then end of turn it moves straight forward 4-6 spaces, and anyone it collides with it pushes and deals damage.&nbsp; I&#39;d have it push them with the token, so they always end up directly in front of (or on) it.&nbsp; End of your next turn if you still have the card in play it keeps going in that same direction, if there&#39;s room for more wording you could have an action on it to turn the bus, although that might be too good.</p><p>It would also mix up his kit a bit, and give him a cool way to push people through his other constructs.</p>",
